  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "fashion-bespoke-individual",
      "topicId": "fashion",
      "sourceOrder": 83,
      "status": "READY_FOR_SAME_READER_FINAL",
      "literalGroups": [
        {
          "group": "prompt_ordered_answers_key",
          "literal": {
            "prompt": "Какой термин Merriam-Webster приводит в примере с костюмом, изготовленным на заказ?",
            "answers": [
              "Прет-а-порте",
              "От-кутюр",
              "Bespoke",
              "Туаль"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 2
          },
          "literalSHA256": "fb11531db5650d33ff79f4e92129a8d7baa5a059cf9d2d056c01212c91f9a130",
          "primaryGround": "MW defines bespoke as custom-made and gives “a bespoke suit” as an example (L52-L62). The distractors are other distinct fashion terms: prêt-à-porter and haute couture in The Met’s toile-production contexts, and toile itself as a prototype (L94-L96).",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "Merriam-Webster L52-L62; The Met L94-L96",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Merriam-Webster приводит bespoke suit как пример вещи, изготовленной на заказ. Newham College включает Bespoke Tailoring в линейку курсов моды и дизайна.",
          "literalSHA256": "3026f190533f4c9d64c66b2be650bb185cf38d1a4c4bb3a74aab31cdf30de5b5",
          "primaryGround": "MW defines bespoke as custom-made and gives a bespoke suit as an example (L52-L62); FTM lists Bespoke Tailoring among Newham College fashion and design courses (L76).",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion82/fashion-textile-museum-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "Merriam-Webster L52-L62; Fashion and Textile Museum L76",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json",
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion82/fashion-textile-museum-capture.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note0",
          "literal": "The Met указывает, что для prêt-à-porter и симметричных дизайнов делают половинную туаль.",
          "literalSHA256": "a4c8508d290697f020426e102736527067793755fb44f7520caacd5a8f203ba6",
          "primaryGround": "The Met says that prêt-à-porter garments with symmetrical designs use a half toile (L96).",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "The Met L94-L96",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note1",
          "literal": "Для haute couture, как и для асимметричных дизайнов, The Met описывает полную туаль.",
          "literalSHA256": "2768686187ababd4a73e48d76b782dce495c051a2271c3256ce84f50bd5ce991",
          "primaryGround": "The Met describes full toiles for haute couture and asymmetrical designs (L96).",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "The Met L94-L96",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note2",
          "literal": "В XVI веке глагол bespeak приобрёл значение «заказывать»; от него произошло слово bespoke.",
          "literalSHA256": "c323efdca12f09ce8d7d2068f2be7440c56e66b6f4a42535770b19125f84b081",
          "primaryGround": "Merriam-Webster says bespeak acquired the meaning “to order” in the 16th century and that bespoke derives from this sense, referring to things ordered before they are made (L78). This is an additional word-history fact about the correct option, beyond the prompt and key.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "Merriam-Webster BESPOKE “Did you know?” L76-L78",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion83/bespoke-mw-capture.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note3",
          "literal": "Туаль — прототип одежды или предварительный трёхмерный эскиз.",
          "literalSHA256": "6f944c27d963bfb36a90dcf5b1ddfc18662eb8134c595d77c496f5afbb26b449",
          "primaryGround": "The Met defines toile as a prototype garment or preliminary three-dimensional sketch (L95).",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ],
          "locator": "The Met L94-L96",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a19c7d/source-fashion81/met-manus-x-machina-capture.json"
          ]
        }
      ],
